# StoryMotion AI Environment Configuration
# None of these variables are required to launch or preview the app.
# The hosted app preview, story generation, scene planning, character consistency,
# fight scene planner, and audio studio open and operate immediately with zero configuration.
#
# For local GPU video rendering, WAN generation connects to your local Windows Helper
# (defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000). You can also configure pairing directly in the Local Engine UI.
#
# Optional custom overrides:
# WAN_ENGINE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# WAN_MODEL=wan-2.1-t2v-1.4b